Adds six read-only RPCs used by crosslink-tui to a Crosslink v14 node:

  get_tfl_finality_status     finality health, BFT height/round/step, quorum power, diagnosis
  get_tfl_quorum_status       per-finalizer voting power, online state and votes
  get_tfl_round_diagnosis     per-round proposal and vote state at the current BFT height
  get_tfl_bft_internal_stats  BFT state sizes and BFT peer list
  get_tfl_bft_block           a decided BFT block (the tip by default)
  get_wallet_sync_status      headless wallet scan height and balances

Base: ShieldedLabs/crosslink_monolith tag v14 (commit eca0207c). Apply from the repository root:

  git apply --check v14-extra-rpcs.patch && git apply v14-extra-rpcs.patch

The RPCs only read state the node already keeps; they change no consensus, networking or
wallet behaviour. Text above the first "diff --git" line is ignored by git apply.

